+The caption uses a LabelViewModel and new private `UI/ReSkate/Throwdowns/LogoName_Widget`, cloned from the game's Label_Widget with all 27 property connections, two links, four events and entity components retained. Its native label element has an 8-degree clockwise transform and a fixed 360-by-56 frame. The combination presenter places this name at (52,341), right aligned below the logo's lower-right side; its rotated bounds fit within the 424-pixel cell. The native white H52 bold font and 75-percent drop shadow make the background-free name readable. Focus uses a private copy of that same font/effect with the game's LightBlue color. Native TextureViewModel interactivity also uses a private native all-white palette with blue focus/selected/pressed colors, so only nontransparent logo pixels and the lettering highlight.
