+# Official ReSkate update with native Throwdowns retained
+
+## Update to 2.0.6 on 11 October 2026
+
+Official tag `v2.0.6`, commit `314d31fe7bf73866b4ae9b6a8195de50ced26312`,
+is merged into the custom branch. Four conflicts were resolved by retaining
+the custom camera activation include and corrected protocol fixture offsets,
+adding the upstream first-person cycle include and teleport command check.
+The native custom pack remains embedded and uses official multiplayer protocol
+49. Both launcher and DLL report 2.0.6. Binary auto-updates remain disabled.
+
+The custom waiting HUD now saves native callbacks before publishing its private
+presenter. Map and respawn pose interruptions keep the loaded-world lobby alive.
+The distant registration icon imports bind to the matching approved challenge
+logo, with all 45 dependencies resident in owning level bundles. An incorrect
+entity-query hook was removed after offline decompilation disproved its role.
+
+All 77 regression tests pass, including the new map interruption/Start/Leave
+coordinator cases. Build and validation logs: `../reskate-206-build.log`,
+`../reskate-206-final-runtime-build.log`, `../reskate-206-ctest.log`.
+The DLL's embedded archive was verified as data without execution. Archive SHA256:
+`bd359876f83796f13b091e7a06cc329d3464e5cf98d8f62d895ee8a92f25cbc7`.
+See `contrib/throwdown-flags/README.md` for asset contracts and pending manual
+confirmation. Throwdown Panel and native celebration work remain deferred.
+
+## Source provenance
+
+Official release: [v2.0.3](https://github.com/Dingo-Shenanigans/ReSkate/releases/tag/v2.0.3), commit `5b7395c3ac189e992de5d7767be2b8dfb0b7695a`, published 2026-10-10 18:41:13 UTC.
+
